OL,3,AFive Israelis wounded and two suspected
OL,4,APalestinian attackers killed in West
OL,5,ABank shooting
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe attack comes at a time of high
OL,8,Ftensions in the West Bank, with
OL,9,Fextremist Jewish settlers targeting
OL,10,FPalestinians during the annual olive
OL,11,Fharvest, and Israel's general election
OL,12,Ftaking place in four days time.
OL,14,FThe Israeli military said it had found
OL,15,Fa large quantity of ammunition in the
OL,16,Fattackers' vehicle. The military said
OL,17,Fthey believe the gunmen had intended to
OL,18,Fcarry out a much larger attack on the
OL,19,Fnearby Route 35, but unexpectedly ran
OL,20,Finto the checkpoint - so instead
OL,21,Fdecided to open fire there.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
