OL,3,AHundreds of flights cancelled as
OL,4,ATyphoon Champi shuts Taiwan
OL,5,
OL,6,FChampi is the latest in a string of
OL,7,Fintense typhoons as a Super El Nino
OL,8,Fheats up the Pacific Ocean and fuels
OL,9,Fstorms. At its peak earlier this week,
OL,10,Fit was the planet's strongest storm of
OL,11,Fthe year so far.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
