OL,3,AHospitals deliberately targeted by
OL,4,ASudan's RSF fighters, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA BBC investigation has found evidence
OL,7,Fthat Sudanese paramilitary fighters
OL,8,Fsystematically destroyed el-Fasher's
OL,9,Fhealthcare system during their long
OL,10,Fsiege and subsequent takeover of the
OL,11,Fcity in Darfur a year ago.
OL,13,FUN human rights chief Volker Turk
OL,14,Fcalled the findings "deeply
OL,15,Fdisturbing", saying multiple attacks by
OL,16,Fthe Rapid Support Forces (RSF) on
OL,17,Fcivilian infrastructure, including
OL,18,Fhealth facilities, were serious
OL,19,Fviolations of international
OL,20,Fhumanitarian law and may amount to war
OL,21,Fcrimes.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
