OL,3,AHospitals deliberately targeted by
OL,4,ASudan's RSF fighters, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RSF has rejected the BBC's
OL,7,Ffindings.
OL,9,FThe health minister of the group's
OL,10,Fcivilian-affiliated government
OL,11,Fdismissed the allegations as
OL,12,Fpropaganda.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
